{% doc %}
  "Also in the kit" callout for a product that is part of one or more bundles.

  The kits are the catalogue's best AOV lever, so a shopper on a component page
  needs to know the set exists. This states the saving in dollars and percent,
  computed from live prices rather than hardcoded, so it can never drift out of
  date or overstate the discount.

  Reads `custom.kits` (list.product_reference), written from the LIVE bundle
  membership by config/link_kits_multi.py. It used to read `custom.kit`, a single
  reference, which could only ever name one kit. Six of the twenty two components
  sit in two or three, so the Cooling Pad page advertised the Travel Kit and said
  nothing about Calm & Comfort, the highest-contribution kit in the range. The
  single reference is still honoured as a fallback if the list is empty.

  The card promotes the kit with the LARGEST dollar saving; any others are named
  on a quiet line underneath, so the page keeps one clear primary action.

  The winner is captured with `assign kit = k` INSIDE the loop. Do not "find the
  best index, then read kit_list[best_idx]": Shopify Liquid will not index an
  array with a variable. `kit_list[best_idx]` silently evaluates to nil, the
  whole card disappears, and no Liquid error is raised anywhere. A literal index
  (`kit_list[0]`) works, which makes the failure look impossible until you probe
  it. Verified live: `{% assign zz = 0 %}{{ kl[zz].title }}` rendered empty while
  the same list iterated fine in a `for` loop.

  Renders nothing unless a kit is available and genuinely cheaper than its parts,
  so a pricing change quietly retires the claim instead of turning it into a
  false one.
{% enddoc %}

{%- liquid
  assign kit_list = product.metafields.custom.kits.value
  assign best_saving = 0
  assign best_handle = ''

  for k in kit_list
    assign s = k.compare_at_price | minus: k.price
    if k.available and s > best_saving
      assign best_saving = s
      assign best_handle = k.handle
      assign kit = k
    endif
  endfor

  if best_saving <= 0
    assign kit = product.metafields.custom.kit.value
    assign best_saving = 0
    if kit.available
      assign best_saving = kit.compare_at_price | minus: kit.price
    endif
  endif
-%}

{%- if kit != blank and best_saving > 0 -%}
  {%- assign pct = best_saving | times: 100 | divided_by: kit.compare_at_price -%}
  {%- assign shown = 0 -%}
  {%- capture more -%}
    {%- for k in kit_list -%}
      {%- assign s = k.compare_at_price | minus: k.price -%}
      {%- if k.handle != best_handle and k.available and s > 0 -%}
        {%- if shown > 0 %} and {% endif -%}
        <a href="{{ k.url }}">{{ k.title }}</a>
        {%- assign shown = shown | plus: 1 -%}
      {%- endif -%}
    {%- endfor -%}
  {%- endcapture -%}

  <div class="wv-kit-wrap">
    <a class="wv-kit" href="{{ kit.url }}">
      {%- if kit.featured_image -%}
        <img
          class="wv-kit__img"
          src="{{ kit.featured_image | image_url: width: 160 }}"
          alt="{{ kit.title | escape }}"
          width="80"
          height="80"
          loading="lazy"
        >
      {%- endif -%}
      <span class="wv-kit__body">
        <span class="wv-kit__eyebrow">Also in the {{ kit.title }}</span>
        <span class="wv-kit__line">
          Buy the set for <strong>{{ kit.price | money }}</strong>
          <s>{{ kit.compare_at_price | money }}</s>
          <span class="wv-kit__save">Save {{ best_saving | money }} ({{ pct }}%)</span>
        </span>
      </span>
      <span class="wv-kit__chev" aria-hidden="true">&rsaquo;</span>
    </a>

    {%- if shown > 0 -%}
      <p class="wv-kit__more">Also part of the {{ more }}.</p>
    {%- endif -%}
  </div>
{%- endif -%}

{% stylesheet %}
  .wv-kit {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 14px;
    padding: 12px 14px;
    border: 1px solid rgb(var(--color-foreground-rgb, 0 0 0) / 0.18);
    border-radius: 10px;
    text-decoration: none;
    color: inherit;
    transition: border-color 160ms ease, background-color 160ms ease;
  }

  .wv-kit:hover {
    border-color: rgb(var(--color-foreground-rgb, 0 0 0) / 0.42);
    background: rgb(var(--color-foreground-rgb, 0 0 0) / 0.03);
  }

  .wv-kit__img {
    inline-size: 52px;
    block-size: 52px;
    object-fit: cover;
    border-radius: 6px;
    flex: none;
  }

  .wv-kit__body {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 3px;
    min-inline-size: 0;
  }

  .wv-kit__eyebrow {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    opacity: 0.65;
  }

  .wv-kit__line {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    line-height: 1.35;
  }

  .wv-kit__line s {
    opacity: 0.5;
    margin-inline-start: 4px;
  }

  .wv-kit__save {
    display: inline-block;
    margin-inline-start: 6px;
    color: #2f7a4d;
    font-weight: 600;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .wv-kit__chev {
    margin-inline-start: auto;
    font-size: 1.4rem;
    opacity: 0.4;
    flex: none;
  }

  .wv-kit__more {
    margin: 8px 2px 0;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    line-height: 1.4;
    opacity: 0.7;
  }

  .wv-kit__more a {
    color: inherit;
    text-underline-offset: 2px;
  }
{% endstylesheet %}
